Instructions for pushing your own configured docker image to hub:
1. Configure the Dockerfile
2. docker login -u "myusername" -p "mypassword" docker.io # do not ignore quote sign here
3. docker buildx create --use (--name container_name)
4. docker buildx build --platform linux/amd64 -t username/image_name:version . --push

# linux/amd64 stands for the architecture used in CHTC

How to link your own docker in CHTC:
1. universe = docker
2. docker_image = username/image_name:version